#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:4
#: 6188a0f51167429ba5fdc77fe17cefaa
msgid "Using Simulation Parameters to Control the Simulation"
msgstr "使用仿真参数控制仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:6
#: b4f24e1bd041457ca689ddc11de16736
msgid ""
"SITL has a large set of parameters to control the simulation. Wind "
"speed/direction, Sensor malfunctions and parameters, RC failures, etc. can "
"be emulated and controlled. They are visible and present when a simulation "
"is running and prefixed by ``SIM_``. A few are detailed below."
msgstr ""
"SITL (软件在环仿真) 拥有大量用于控制仿真的参数。风速/风向、传感器故障和参数、遥控失效等均可模拟和控制。仿真运行时这些参数可见，以 "
"``SIM_`` 为前缀。下面详述其中几个。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:9
#: ce6303e930a44a12a8b57fffa427a239
msgid "Setting parameters"
msgstr "设置参数"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:11
#: d1951f8edc4a4d3fa237b7ba3ca6c4d2
msgid ""
"If the attached GCS is Mission Planner, you would use the CONFIG/Full "
"Parameter List or Tree to change the parameters. The following gives "
"examples using MAVProxy commands to change the parameter values."
msgstr ""
"如果连接的地面站是 Mission Planner，您可以使用 CONFIG/完整参数列表或参数树来更改参数。以下给出使用 MAVProxy "
"命令更改参数值的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:13
#: c8b8467708af46c6b3e9ef995f80dbbd
msgid ""
"Many of the following tasks involve setting parameter values over MAVLink, "
"which you do using the ``param set`` command as shown:"
msgstr "以下许多任务涉及通过 MAVLink 设置参数值，使用如下所示的 ``param set`` 命令："

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:20
#: d22a337b3df0465490c3ad3284819fb5
msgid ""
"All available parameters can be listed using ``param show``. The SITL-"
"specific parameters start with ``SIM_``, and can be obtained using:"
msgstr "所有可用参数可通过 ``param show`` 列出。SITL 专用参数以 ``SIM_`` 开头，可通过以下方式获取："

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:29
#: 1ffc664ee3c64aaeb74b264ec4e039bc
msgid ""
"A table of user settable SITL-specific parameters can be found in `SITL.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/SITL.cpp>`__"
" When you change a parameter the value remains in the virtual EEPROM after "
"you restart SITL. Remember to change it back if you don't want it any more "
"(or :ref:`reload/reset the parameters <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_loading_a_parameter_set>`)."
msgstr ""
"用户可设置的 SITL 专用参数列表可在 `SITL.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/SITL.cpp>`__"
" 中找到。更改参数后，该值在重启 SITL 后仍保留在虚拟 EEPROM 中。如不再需要，请记得将其改回（或 :ref:`重新加载/重置参数 "
"<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing_loading_a_parameter_set>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:36
#: f2eaf03714064c97b455e1319d51ee8e
msgid "Changing the speed of the simulation"
msgstr "更改仿真速度"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:38
#: 10d3eb3c6af2437d949d952bd1278b2b
msgid ""
"Most of the simulator backends (native, X-plane, etc.) support changing the "
"speed while running (NOT Realflight). Just set the ``SIM_SPEEDUP`` parameter"
" as needed. A value of 1 means normal wall-clock time. A value of 5 means 5x"
" realtime. A value of 0.1 means 1/10th of real time."
msgstr ""
"大多数仿真器后端（原生、X-plane 等）支持运行时更改速度（Realflight 除外）。只需按需设置 ``SIM_SPEEDUP`` 参数。值为 "
"1 表示正常实时速度，值为 5 表示 5 倍实时，值为 0.1 表示实时速度的 1/10。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:43
#: f34f570a08504be68ed72b75ee709abc
msgid ""
"Running with high-levels of speedup can result in enough network traffic "
"that MAVProxy can’t keep up. An error such as “Set RC override timeout” or "
"the vehicle entering GCS failsafe are typical of these failures. Reducing "
"the ``SIM_SPEEDUP`` factor is typically sufficient to avoid this problem. "
"Also, using the ``--udp`` options will use UDP instead of the slower TCP "
"communication protocol and can help avoid this issue at higher speedups."
msgstr ""
"以较高倍速运行可能产生大量网络流量，导致 MAVProxy 跟不上。「Set RC override "
"timeout」等错误或飞行器进入地面站失控保护是此类故障的典型表现。降低 ``SIM_SPEEDUP`` 因子通常足以避免此问题。此外，使用 "
"``--udp`` 选项将用 UDP 替代较慢的 TCP 通信协议，在较高倍速时有助于避免此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:46
#: 7419ee2e6a3c4eb7a4de7bfdab436362
msgid "Loading a parameter set"
msgstr "加载参数集"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:48
#: b77ed9a1b68a4e18b796da20f3a5e5e8
msgid ""
"When starting SITL the first time, the device will be configured with "
"default parameters for the vehicle/frame type. Typically, you will want to "
"replace these with values that simulate the desired vehicle and environment "
"conditions."
msgstr "首次启动 SITL 时，设备将使用飞行器/机架类型的默认参数进行配置。通常您会希望将其替换为模拟所需飞行器和环境条件的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:56
#: c991739919dc41da9a2d3fc2579332af
msgid ""
"the working directory is the directory in which MAVProxy starts, not the "
"simulation"
msgstr "工作目录是 MAVProxy 启动时所在的目录，而非仿真目录"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:58
#: 774240bdc83640e09725ec006d13d465
msgid ""
"You can re-load the parameters later if you choose, or revert to the default"
" parameters by starting SITL (**sim_vehicle.py**) with the ``-w`` flag."
msgstr "您可以选择稍后重新加载参数，或通过以 ``-w`` 标志启动 SITL（**sim_vehicle.py**）来恢复默认参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:62
#: d68a7d2d5dbb40faa57c11d35a7452df
msgid ""
"You may have to load them again, after typing ``param fetch``, in order to "
"load parameters that require enabling before presenting their parameter set."
"  And, in some cases, you may even need to restart SITL in order for some "
"new parameters, such as output function changes, to take effect. This can be"
" avoided if you add the parameter file during the start of SITL with the \""
"--add-param-file=*pathtofile* \"....ie: sim_vehicle.py -f "
"flightaxis:192.168.x.x - -map - -console --add-param-file=*pathtofile* -w. "
"This adds the param file as a default and then wipes any previous param "
"changes that may exist back to the defaults."
msgstr ""
"您可能需要在输入 ``param fetch`` 后再次加载参数，以便加载需要先启用才能显示其参数集的参数。在某些情况下，您甚至可能需要重启 "
"SITL，才能使某些新参数（例如输出功能更改）生效。如果在 SITL 启动时通过 「--add-param-file=*pathtofile*」 "
"添加参数文件，则可以避免这种情况……即：sim_vehicle.py -f flightaxis:192.168.x.x - -map - "
"-console --add-param-file=*pathtofile* "
"-w。这会将参数文件作为默认值添加，然后将之前可能存在的任何参数更改恢复为默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:64
#: f8497239791d4905b4d0b1bb924b0074
msgid ""
"Parameters can also be saved. For example, to save the parameters in a file "
"in the present working directory:"
msgstr "参数也可以保存。例如，将参数保存到当前工作目录中的文件："

#: ../../source/docs/SITL_simulation_parameters.rst:70
#: 43f3239c3b914f67b7d7b841214df67d
msgid ""
"the \"default\" parameter set emulates the parameter default values "
"contained in the firmware. These are used at startup for parameters, UNLESS "
"the user has previously changed a parameter(s) which are stored in the "
"autopilot's flash, in which case those changed values are used for those "
"changed parameters. In SITL, these changes are stored in a file in the "
"simulation startup directory named ``eeprom.bin``. The above param load and "
"save commands deal with these user set values for the parameters, not the "
"firmware default values created at simulation start, which can be changed "
"using the ``--add-param-file`` startup option."
msgstr ""
"「默认」参数集模拟固件中包含的参数默认值。这些值在启动时用于参数，除非用户之前已更改了存储在飞控 flash "
"中的参数，在这种情况下，对于那些已更改的参数将使用更改后的值。在 SITL 中，这些更改存储在仿真启动目录中名为 ``eeprom.bin`` "
"的文件里。上述 param load 和 save 命令处理的是这些用户设置的参数值，而非仿真启动时创建的固件默认值，固件默认值可使用 ``--add-"
"param-file`` 启动选项更改。"

